{"about_the_game":"<strong>Simultree</strong> is an <strong>incremental game</strong> about monitoring <strong>life simulations</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run life simulations</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/0be839a56195ad1b6ab8e6f03489a8e0.poster.avif?t=1768557650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/0be839a56195ad1b6ab8e6f03489a8e0.webm?t=1768557650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/0be839a56195ad1b6ab8e6f03489a8e0.mp4?t=1768557650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You're a <strong>scientist</strong> who run simulations of small entities in order to understand them better!<br>These entities will yield <strong>points</strong> upon eating fruits, but you need to make sure they don't die of hunger. <strong>:(</strong><br>Use your <strong>magnifying glass</strong> to retrieve these points and spend them in the <strong>skill tree</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new things to play with</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/8391a16b6f0eef7fc13f9a85e47446f2.poster.avif?t=1768557650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/8391a16b6f0eef7fc13f9a85e47446f2.webm?t=1768557650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/8391a16b6f0eef7fc13f9a85e47446f2.mp4?t=1768557650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>More entities? Stronger entities? Bigger magnifying glass? More genetic traits? Automatic point harvester?<br>Do what you want, <strong>you're the only scientist anyway.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/7ec38f6b660275ca96e8c39db8234af2.poster.avif?t=1768557650\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/7ec38f6b660275ca96e8c39db8234af2.webm?t=1768557650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/7ec38f6b660275ca96e8c39db8234af2.mp4?t=1768557650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Why? As a scientist you need to take some time off.<br><strong>Don't procrastinate too much and don't forget to sign your simulation report!</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811840?t=1768557650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/2ea979bc2ea821089d7f3048f81480bdefc26884/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768557650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/8c1f46e20193e150fbd92ab9dc62a0661e91752f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768557650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/8c1f46e20193e150fbd92ab9dc62a0661e91752f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768557650","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Simultree</strong> is an <strong>incremental game</strong> about monitoring <strong>life simulations</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run life simulations</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811840/extras/0be839a56195ad1b6ab8e6f03489a8e0.poster.avif?